<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms seek 50,000 tonnes Chinese corn.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms seek 50,000 tonnes Chinese corn.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean feed milling companies are seeking 50,000 tonnes of Chinese corn for arrival in May, trade sources said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
